  "details": "<p>This Imgur-Enlil is\u00a0mentioned in a fragmentarily preserved inscription of \u0160ama\u0161-re\u0161a-u\u1e63ur of Suhu. The city mentioned in this Akkadian text\u00a0is presumably located in/near Suhu, and is not the Assyrian city of the same name.</p>",
